# Case: Live send progress in history detail
# Mode: native
# Purpose: Show the progress ring and the per-file popover while a large file is sent to a paired device.
# Steps: Pair one production peer, submit a 90 MB file, send, pause the peer after 8 MB so the send stalls part-way, hover the delivery row, then resume the peer.
# Expected: The row shows an unfinished transfer with bytes written; the popover lists the file name and its bytes; after resume the row shows 1/1 sent.
# Forbidden: A fixture progress value, a finished state while the peer is paused, or missing recording.

start
start-pairing-peer
ui-wait listItem 管理设备…
ui-click listItem 管理设备…
ui-wait button 邀请设备
ui-click button 邀请设备
ui-wait radio 完整票据
ui-click radio 完整票据
ui-wait button 复制票据
peer-pair-desktop
ui-wait text '核对并批准'
ui-click button 接受
assert-paired
ui-wait button 完成
ui-click button 完成
enable-sync
submit-sized-file progress-1 90
ui-wait listItem '~.*big-progress-1.bin.*'
ui-click listItem '~.*big-progress-1.bin.*'
ui-wait text '0/1 台设备'
send-newest-to-peer progress-send
peer-pause-at-bytes 8
ui-wait button '~.*Mac-mini.*发送中'
ui-hover button '~.*Mac-mini.*发送中'
screenshot stalled
peer-resume
ui-wait text '1/1 台设备' 90
screenshot sent
stop-policy-peer
